            "title": "CoreWeave-Nvidia deal, Oracle & TikTok, Corteva explores breakup",
            "description": "<p>Market Catalysts host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/\">Julie Hyman</a> examines some of Monday's trending tickers: CoreWeave's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CRWV\">CRWV</a>) cloud computing capacity deal with Nvidia (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA\">NVDA</a>), Oracle's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ORCL\">ORCL</a>) stock moves around US-China talks on TikTok, and the potential breakup of Corteva (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CTVA\">CTVA</a>) reported by<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/m/942fca4c-0dc0-331c-b644-fd3dcb815d6f/corteva-a-50-billion.html\"> the Wall Street Journal.</a></p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-catalysts/\">Market Catalysts</a>.</p>",
